{
  "slug": "clawkeeper",
  "name": "Clawkeeper",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Frictionless security, compliance, and threat detection for Claude Code and Co-Work. Advanced Behavioral detection patterns catch credential exfiltration, reverse shells, prompt injection, and supply chain attacks before execution. \n\nIncludes slash commands for security auditing, secret scanning, and plugin inspection. Works instantly with no account — zero network calls in local  mode.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `audit` (Run a full Clawkeeper security audit of your Claude Code environment), `connect` (Deprecated alias for /clawkeeper-code:login), `cowork-install` (Install the Clawkeeper PreToolUse hook into Cowork (Claude Desktop)), `cowork-status` (Show install state of the Clawkeeper Cowork PreToolUse hook — hook script, API key, and per-workspace install), `cowork-uninstall` (Remove the Clawkeeper Cowork PreToolUse hook from every Cowork workspace on this machine), `disconnect` (Remove Clawkeeper hooks and API key), `inspect` (Audit all installed Claude Code plugins, skills, hooks, and MCP servers for malicious behavior), `login` (Log in to Clawkeeper to link the plugin to your account), and 6 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install clawkeeper@claude-community` from `rad-security/claude-code-plugin` (`plugins/clawkeeper-code`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 14,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
